{"AnnouncementsResult":{"TimeStamp":"2026-08-13T22:03:53+08:00","Announcement":[{"ID":"128","Text":"Due to vehicle breakdown along Kent Ridge Crescent, Services A1, D1, R1 and K are affected.","Status":"Enabled","Priority":"2","Affected_Service_Ids":"A1,D1,K,R1","Created_On":"2026-07-14T15:33:42+08:00","Created_By":"National University Of Singapore"},{"ID":"126","Text":"The NUS NextBus app will be retired on 29 May (after exams). Please check out the improved shuttle bus info features in <a href=\"https:\/\/about-univus.nus.edu.sg\/univus_download\/\">the uNivUS app<\/a>. From next semester, shuttle bus info will be provided via uNivUS. Thank you for your support.","Status":"Enabled","Priority":"2","Affected_Service_Ids":"","Created_On":"2026-04-22T10:05:35+08:00","Created_By":"National University Of Singapore"},{"ID":"12","Text":"Subscribe to the new <a href=\"http:\/\/t.me\/NUSOnTheMove\">NUS On The Move<\/a> Telegram channel for mobility-related updates, news and promotions in NUS!","Status":"Enabled","Priority":"2","Affected_Service_Ids":"","Created_On":"2022-08-08T15:15:04+08:00","Created_By":"National University Of Singapore"},{"ID":"9","Text":"Come and be an <a href=\"https:\/\/forms.office.com\/r\/zrq3mmFACT\">ISB Mystery Rider<\/a>! Five $20 vouchers are up for grabs every month. Each form submission gets you an additional chance to win!","Status":"Enabled","Priority":"2","Affected_Service_Ids":"","Created_On":"2022-07-07T14:15:04+08:00","Created_By":"National University Of Singapore"}]}}